# cmd.exe mishandles labels/goto in batch files with LF-only line endings.
# Check out (and ZIP-download) .cmd files with CRLF.
# .ps1 is deliberately left alone: Install-SendTo.ps1 compares the local Bulk-Print.ps1
# with the GitHub raw copy (always LF) byte for byte, so CRLF there would re-download every run.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
